      <name>Cafe Harati (Bhaktapur - Primary)</name>
      <description>Cafe Harati - Bhaktapur (Primary)
📍 Taumadhi Square Near Nyatapola Temple, Bhaktapur 44800, Nepal
📞 +977 1-6610346
🔗 https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g424934-d32807326-Reviews-Cafe_Harati-Bhaktapur_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html
